WOW-BG3 bg3le patch 0012: a mod's own IO folder (on top of 0001-0011).

A native plugin names a top-level folder of Ext.IO's user root and where it really lives
(bg3le_io_root_add(name, absolute dir), at plugin init, before any Lua runs). Ext.IO.LoadFile (user context),
SaveFile and AppendFile paths under that name read and write there; every other path is upstream's. WOW-BG3's
launcher registers wow-bg3/ as Mods/WOW-BG3/data/io, so nothing the mod makes lives outside its own folder.
Patch 0006's boot-path-overrides.txt (and 0008's .wait beside it) is read from the registered folder when there is one.

